\newlabel{tab:taps}{{I}{3}{Per-tap results on 16\,nm: first failing voltage $V_f$ (V, SYSMON), measured margin $m$ and predicted offset $\Dst $ (ps); $m'$, $m''$: margin of the same routed design with the 250 and the 125\,ps guard. $m>0$: the reading reached zero before the first error}{table.1}{}}
